return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;','language'=>'oci','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.2','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:30+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:30+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'Mandat quand quichatz Activar Babilim, e tornamai se lo site se deu enregistrar de nòu : l\'URL de vòstre site, las versions de WordPress, de PHP e de Babilim, la lenga de vòstre site e las lengas utilizadas, e una clau publica generada per aqueste site.','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'Mandat a cada verificacion : la lista dels empeutons e tèmas installats amb l\'estat de las traduccions Babilim installadas per eles, las lengas utilizadas, e de còdis de diagnostic cortes.','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'Cada requèsta inclutz l\'URL de vòstre site, e lo geton d\'accès del site es inclús cada còp que lo servici ne a besonh.','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Çò que Babilim manda al servici','Your site\'s URL'=>'L\'URL de vòstre site','WordPress version'=>'Version de WordPress','PHP version'=>'Version de PHP','Babilim version'=>'Version de Babilim','Your site\'s language'=>'La lenga de vòstre site','Languages in use on your site'=>'Lengas utilizadas sul vòstre site','A public key for this site'=>'Una clau publica per aqueste site','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'Una clau publica generada per aqueste site, utilizada per provar que las requèstas venon vertadièrament d\'aqueste site. Sola la mitat publica es mandada ; la mitat privada demòra sul vòstre site.','Installed plugins and themes'=>'Empeutons e tèmas installats','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, and the languages it already includes. For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Per cada empeuton e tèma installat : son nom (slug), sa version, son domeni de tèxte, s\'es listat sus WordPress.org, e las lengas que ja inclutz. Per cada traduccion Babilim que avètz installada : quina version es, quora foguèt verificada pel darrièr còp, e s\'a capitat la verificacion dels fichièrs.','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'Fichièrs d\'origina (solament se confirmatz un mandadís)','Diagnostic codes'=>'Còdis de diagnostic','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'Fins a 20 còdis de diagnostic cortes (per exemple, un fichièr de traduccion que a fracassat sa verificacion), cadun amb l\'empeuton o lo tèma, la lenga e l\'ora quand s\'es produch. Contenon jamai cap de tèxte de vòstre site ni cap de tèxte traduch.','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'%1$d site d\'aqueste malhum es configurat per escafar son identitat Babilim quand l\'empeuton es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia de Babilim a %2$s. Per gardar l\'identitat, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres Babilim d\'aqueste site, e tornatz desactivar. Desactivar çaquelà?' . "\0" . '%1$d sites d\'aqueste malhum son configurats per escafar lor identitat Babilim quand l\'empeuton es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueles sites poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia de Babilim a %2$s. Per gardar las identitats, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres Babilim de cada site, e tornatz desactivar. Desactivar çaquelà?','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s) : %3$s','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s res a far.','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s : %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s : %2$s (%3$s)','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s : %2$s. Causissètz la lenga.','%d failed'=>'%d fracassat' . "\0" . '%d fracassats','%d not yet tried'=>'%d pas encara ensajat' . "\0" . '%d pas encara ensajats','%d report is waiting. "Always share" and "Don\'t share" apply to all of them.'=>'%d rapòrt es en espèra. « Partejar tostemps » e « Pas partejar » s\'aplican a totes.' . "\0" . '%d rapòrts son en espèra. « Partejar tostemps » e « Pas partejar » s\'aplican a totes.','%d skipped'=>'%d daissat de caire' . "\0" . '%d daissats de caire','%d succeeded'=>'%d capitat' . "\0" . '%d capitats','%d to install'=>'%d d\'installar' . "\0" . '%d d\'installar','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(una clau publica generada per aqueste site)','(detected)'=>'(detectat)','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(solament de còdis e de coordenadas generics)','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Un netejatge es estat mes en pausa lo %1$s : %2$s. Res es pas estat suprimit.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Un 