c installs are on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Las traduccions disponiblas se pòdon installar en un clic, e las que manquen se pòdon demandar. Quand las installacions automaticas son activadas, las traduccions que lo servici indica coma disponiblas per las lengas que gerissètz son installadas pendent la sincronizacion doas còps per jorn.','Available · %s'=>'Disponibla · %s','Babilim'=>'Babilim','Babilim Settings'=>'Paramètres de Babilim','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim ajusta de traduccions per cada lenga marcada aicí.','Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site\'s public directory), or ask your host for one.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut confirmar un dossièr temporari en defòra del site web, doncas lo component es pas estat empaquetat e degun fichièr es pas estat televersat. Definissètz BABILIM_TEMP_DIR dins wp-config.php coma un dossièr scriptible en defòra de la raiç web (per exemple un dossièr al costat de, e non pas dins, lo repertòri public de vòstre site), o demandatz-ne un a vòstre albergador.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut acabar la verificacion d\'aqueste site.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim a pas pogut acabar l\'activacion (%1$s) : %2$s','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut acabar la verificacion d\'aqueste site (lo servici a pas pogut lo recontactar). L\'enregistrament es en pausa.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut verificar aqueste site, doncas res es pas telecargat ni installat tant que la verificacion capita pas.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim a pas pogut verificar aqueste sit, doncas res es pas telecargat ni installat.','Babilim gets translations from the Babilim service for the plugins and themes on this site that have none for your language, and installs the ones your service plan covers.'=>'Babilim recupèra las traduccions del Servici Babilim per las extensions e los tèmas d\'aqueste site que n\'an pas per vòstra lenga, e installa las que vòstre plan de servici cobrís.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim es pas encara activat per aqueste site.','Babilim has not installed any translation for this language.'=>'Babilim a pas installat cap de traduccion per aquesta lenga.','Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?'=>'Babilim a rencontrat una error. Partejar un rapòrt d\'error ?','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Babilim a installat %d traduccion automaticament dempuèi vòstra darrièra visita.' . "\0" . 'Babilim a installat %d traduccions automaticament dempuèi vòstra darrièra visita.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim es desactivat. Pas res es mai enviat ; las traduccions ja installadas contunhan de foncionar.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim es activat : aqueste site es verificat e %d composant es estat trobat.' . "\0" . 'Babilim es activat : aqueste site es verificat e %d composants son estats trobats.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim activa e verifica aqueste sit… (darrièr ensag : %s)','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim activa e verifica aqueste sit… Tornatz cargar aquesta pagina o esperatz que la verificacion programada s\'acabe.','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim es pas activat.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim es configurat per escafar l\'identitat d\'aqueste site quand l\'empeuton es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia de Babilim a %s. Per gardar l\'identitat, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres de Babilim, e tornatz desactivar. Desactivar çaquelà?','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim a agotat lo temps disponible per aquesta etapa e contunharà a la verificacion seguenta.','Babilim settings'=>'Paramètres de Babilim','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'La sincronizacion de Babilim es temporàriament retardada pel servici (limit de requèstas) ; tornarà ensajar aprèp %s.','Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again.'=>'Babilim es estat mes a jorn pendent que aqueste televersament èra en espèra. Lo paquet ancian es estat abandonat ; confirmatz tornamai lo televersament.','Babilim will upload these files from %1$s (version %2$s): every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in its main folder. They are used to find the text that needs translating and to identify the plugin or theme.'=>'Babilim televersarà aquestes fichièrs de %1$s (version %2$s) : tots los fichièrs .php e .js, tots los fichièrs block.json, e readme.txt, readme.md, style.css e theme.json dins son dossièr principal. Son utilizats per trobar lo tèxte de traduire e per identificar l\'empeuton o lo tèma.','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest es pas disponible : %s','Back'=>'Retorn','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Avètz ja crompat una licéncia per aqueste domeni? Picatz lo còdi de restauracion recebut a la comanda.','Broken placeholder'=>'Plaçador copat','Build'=>'Compilacion','Built'=>'Generat','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Las accions en gròs s\'aplican pas qu\'a la lenga seleccionada de cada composant seleccionat.','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Las accions en gròs s\'aplican a cada lenga correspondenta de cada composant seleccionat.','Bulk download:'=>'Telecargament en massa :','Bulk request:'=>'Demanda en massa :','Bulk update:'=>'Mesa a jorn en massa :','Bundled with the plugin'=>'Inclús dins l\'extension','Bundled with the theme'=>'Inclús dins lo tèma','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'En quichant Activar, acceptatz d\'enviar a Babilim las informacions listadas çaisús.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'En contunhant, confirmatz qu\'avètz lo dreit de mandar aqueste composant.','Cancel'=>'Anullar','Category'=>'Categoria','Check again'=>'Tornar verificar','Check again now'=>'Tornar verificar ara','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'La comanda es pas disponibla per aqueste site pel moment.','Choose'=>'Causir','Choose a category…'=>'Causir una categoria…','Choose a language'=>'Causir una lenga','Choose a language…'=>'Causir una lenga…','Clear filters'=>'Escafar los filtres','Close'=>'Tampar','Component'=>'Composant','Confirm'=>'Confirmar','Conflicting keys'=>'Claus en conflicte','Continue'=>'Contunhar','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Contunhar amb lo lòt seguent (%d demorant)','Continuing…'=>'