 e las qu\'apondètz manualament). Cap de lenga es pas tractada diferentament d\'una autra.','Excluded'=>'Exclús','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'Los fichièrs amb d\'autres noms o d\'autras extensions son pas inclusos, ni los dossièrs uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules e languages, los fichièrs amagats, o los fichièrs que lor nom correspond a de secrèts corrents (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Los fichièrs de còdi pòdon encara conténer de tèxte o de donadas que volguèssetz pas partejar ; verificatz-los se sètz pas segur. Lo servici suprimís tornamai los meteisses tipes de fichièrs a l\'arribada.','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Completa las traduccions mancantas dels empeutons e dels tèmas ja installats sus vòstre site.','Free'=>'Gratuit','Free-plan slots'=>'Emplaçaments del plan gratuit','General'=>'General','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Se aquesta opcion es activada, la desinstallacion escafa tanben l\'identitat d\'aqueste site. La licéncia pagada ligada a aqueste site poirà pas èsser restaurada automaticament après; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia de Babilim a %s per la recuperar.','Included'=>'Inclús','Included in index'=>'Inclús dins l\'indèx','Install available translations automatically'=>'Installar automaticament las traduccions disponiblas','Installed'=>'Installada','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Las traduccions installadas son gardadas, mas cap de verificacion ni de telecargament se lançarà pas.','Installed · %s'=>'Installada · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Installat · bastit per a %1$s, aqueste site a %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Installada · bastida per a %s, la version novèla a fracassat','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s, version novèla planificada','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s, traduccion de la version novèla en cors…','Installed · built for %s; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Installat · bastit per a %s ; aqueste empeuton o tèma es pas mai cobèrt pel plan de servici del site','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Installada · bastida per a una version diferenta, la version novèla a fracassat','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta, version novèla planificada','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Installat · bastit per a una version diferenta, traduccion de la version novèla en cors…','Installed · built for a different version; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Installat · bastit per una version diferenta ; aqueste empeuton o tèma es pas mai cobèrt pel plan de servici del site','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Es emmagazinat pel provesidor d\'albergament del servici e tractat per de modèls d\'IA per produire la traduccion.','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Gardar mas pròprias subrecargaments de traduccion quand se purga tot o quand se desinstalla aqueste empeuton.','Language'=>'Lenga','Language:'=>'Lenga :','Languages'=>'Lengas','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Lengas trobadas sus aqueste sit : %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Darrièr netejatge lo %1$s : %2$d novèlament marcats, %3$d fichièr(s) suprimit(s), %4$d enregistrament(s) levat(s).','Maintenance'=>'Mantenença','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'L\'estat de la mantenença es pas disponible pel moment.','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifèst indisponible : %s','Negation reversed'=>'Negacion inversada','No'=>'Non','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Cap de build es pas disponible per telecargar per aquestes paramètres de lenga.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Cap de netejatge es pas encara estat lançat.','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Cap de compausant correspond pas a aquestes filtres. %s','No components synced yet.'=>'Cap de component pas encara sincronizat.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Cap de traduccion installada correspond.','No language is managed yet.'=>'Cap de lenga es pas encara gerida.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Cap de desfisa en espèra per aqueste nonce.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Cap de desfís en espèra a verificar.','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Cap d\'extension o de tèma pas trobat.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Cap de build precedent per restaurar.','No record for %s'=>'Cap d\'enregistrament per %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Cap d\'identificant de site es pas enregistrat dins un fichièr per renovelar un geton.','No — component inactive'=>'Non — composant inactiu','No — component removed'=>'Non — composant suprimit','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Non — la version installada es diferenta de l\'activa','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'server_build_id invalid : %s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'Pas cobèrt pel plan de servici gratuit','Not installed'=>'Pas installat','Not registered yet'=>'Pas encara enregistrat','Not supported'=>'Pas pres en carga','Not verified'=>'Pas verificat','Note (optional)'=>'Nòta (facultativa)','Nothing to choose.'=>'I a pas res de causir.','Nothing to confirm.'=>'I a pas res de confirmar.','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Desactivat per defaut : suprimir l\'empeuton conserva l\'identitat d\'aqueste site, aital una reinstallacion la pòt tornar utilizar.','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Un o mantun fichièr servit correspondon pas mai al manifèst.','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Crompa unica per aqueste site : %1$s %2$s. Inclutz totas las actualizacions de traduccions a venir. Lo pagament es gerit per Paddle dins un onglet novèl.','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Sol un administrator de la ret pòt far aquò, perque modifica de fichièrs de traduccion partejats per cada site d\'aquesta ret.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Sols los empeutons e los tèmas pòdon èstre empaquetats.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Sonque quand confirmatz un televersament per un empeuton o un tèma que es pas sus WordPress.org : tots los fichièrs .php e .js, tots los fichièrs block.json, e readme.txt, readme.md, style.css e theme.json dins lo dossièr principal d\'aqueste component, en zip, aprèp aver daissat de caire los fichièrs que correspondon a de secrèts corrents.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Dobrir los paramètres de Babilim','Original language'=>'Lenga d\'origina','Original string'=>'Cadena d\'origina','Paid'=>'De pagament','Partner'=>'Partenari','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Verificatz que vòstre sit siá accessible dempuèi Internet, puèi tornatz ensajar.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Causissètz una categoria per aqueste senhalament.','Plugin'=>'Extension','Plugin · %s'=>'Extension · %s','Plugins'=>'Extensions','Preview'=>'Previsualizacion','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Crompa restaurada. Aqueste site a ara una licéncia.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Lo nombre d\'entradas tornadas a analisar correspond pas a l\'indèx bastit.','Re-verify'=>'Tornar verificar','Rebuild index now'=>'Tornar bastir l\'indèx ara','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Refús d\'escriure fora del repertòri dels fichièrs de lenga de Babilim.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'A la responsa d\'enregistrament li mancavan de camps obligatoris.','Registration restarted.'=>'Enregistrament tornat començar.','Remove'=>'Suprimir','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Suprimir tot çò qu\'a installat Babilim','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Suprimir tot çò qu\'a installat Babilim ? Aquò suprimís totes los fichièrs de lenga qu\'a installats per cada extension e tèma d\'aqueste site.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Suprimir la traduccion %2$s de %1$s d\'aqueste site ?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'%d composant installat suprimit.' . "\0" . '%d composants installats suprimits.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Levat aprèp un fracàs de la verificacion d\'integritat','Removed.'=>'Suprimit.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Suprimís totes los fichièrs de lenga qu\'a installats Babilim per cada extension e tèma d\'aqueste site.','Report a problem'=>'Senhalar un problèma','Report translation'=>'Senhalar la traduccion','Request newer translation'=>'Demandar una traduccion mai recenta','Request translation'=>'Demandar una traduccion','Requestable'=>'Demandable','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Demandar una traduccion met aqueste empeuton o tèma sus un dels emplaçaments del plan de servici gratuit per aqueste site (la limita es %1$d per als tèmas e %2$d per als empeutons), levat s\'en a ja un. Un emplaçament demòra utilizat, e una traduccion fracassada lo liberís pas.','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Demandar una traduccion met aqueste empeuton o tèma sus un dels emplaçaments del plan de servici gratuit per aqueste site, levat s\'en a ja un. Un emplaçament demòra utilizat, e una traduccion fracassada lo liberís pas.','Requesting…'=>'Demanda…','Restart registration'=>'Tornar començar l\'enregistrament','Restore code'=>'Còdi de restauracion','Restore purchase'=>'Restaurar l\'achat','Retry request'=>'Tornar ensajar la demanda','Roll back'=>'Tornar en arrièr','Roll back and report'=>'Tornar en arrièr e senhalar','Roll back and send report'=>'Restaurar la version precedenta e enviar un rapòrt','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'Restaurar la traduccion %2$s de %1$s a la compilacion precedenta ?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Retorn en arrièr e senhalat.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Retorn a la build precedenta efectuat.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Retorn en arrièr, mas lo senhalament a pas pogut èsser enviat : %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'La restauracion de la version precedenta espotiriá « %1$s » (%2$s), qu\'es ara servit per un autre composant installat (%3$s) ; res es pas estat modificat.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'A la responsa de rotacion del geton li mancava site_token.','Save changes'=>'Enregistrar las modificacions','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Planificat, en espèra de tractament','Search'=>'Cercar','Search components'=>'Cercar de components','Search the installed translations'=>'Cercar dins las traduccions installadas','Select all'=>'Tot seleccionar','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Seleccionatz mens de compausants : al maximum %1$d operacions per execucion (n\'avètz seleccionat %2$d).','Send report'=>'Enviar un rapòrt','Service plan'=>'Plan de servici','Settings'=>'Paramètres','Share error reports'=>'Partejar los rapòrts d\'error','Share this report'=>'Partejar aqueste rapòrt','Show a new restore code'=>'Afichar un nòu còdi de restauracion','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Mostrar l\'entrada « Senhalar una traduccion » dins la barra d\'espleches d\'administracion','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Una part del tèxte d\'aqueste composant es escrich dirèctament dins lo còdi pel sieu autor e pòt pas èsser traduch per un paquet de lenga.','Status'=>'Estat','Status unknown'=>'Estat desconegut','String context'=>'Contèxte de la cadena','Suggested translation'=>'Traduccion suggerida','Supplementary translation index'=>'Indèx de traduccions suplementari','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'L\'indèx de traduccions suplementari es estat reconstruit.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Mantenença de las traduccions suplementàrias','Supplementary translations'=>'Traduccions suplementàrias','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Netejatge interromput sens daissar cap d\'element orfanèl : %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Netejatge acabat : %d fichièr suprimit.' . "\0" . 'Netejatge acabat : %d fichièrs suprimits.','Sweep now'=>'Netejar ara','Sync complete.'=>'Sincronizacion acabada.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Mercé. Vòstre senhalament es estat enviat.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Aqueste composant es pas installat sus aqueste site, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Aquò sembla pas un còdi de restauracion.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Aquò es pas un còde de paramètres de lenga WordPress valid. Res es pas estat enregistrat.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Aquò es pas un identificant de compilacion valid.','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'Aquel ecran de cargament èra despassat : un autre cargament es estat preparat dempuèi. Res es pas estat mandat. Repassatz lo cargament actual a partir de la Lista de Translations.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Lo cambiament a pas pogut èsser enregistrat dins l\'indèx de traduccions; tornatz ensajar.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Lo netejatge s\'es executat, mas unes de sos cambiaments an pas pogut èsser enregistrats dins l\'indèx de traduccions ; lo netejatge seguent los tornarà ensajar.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Lo component a pas cap de fichièr que se pòt televersar.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Lo composant es pas dins lo repertòri dels extensions o dels tèmas.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Lo fichièr principal del composant es pas estat trobat.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'A la responsa de telecargament li mancava un emplaçament utilizable.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'L\'entrada dobrís un panèl per cercar las traduccions que Babilim a installadas sus aqueste site e n\'en senhalar una.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Lo camp « %1$s » es tròp long : a %2$d caractèrs e la limita es %3$d. Res es pas estat enviat ; mercé de l\'abreujar e tornar ensajar.','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'Lo plan de servici gratuit dona a cada site un nombre limitat d\'emplaçaments per als empeutons e los tèmas ; los emplaçaments utilizats son afichats dins Settings aprèp aver activat Babilim.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Lo domeni donat « %1$s » correspond ni al slug pròpri del manifèst del paquet « %2$s » ni a son text_domain « %3$s ».','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'L\'indèx fusionat de \'%s\' es estat reconstruch, mas l\'indèx de traduccions l\'a pas pogut enregistrar ; la reconstruccion seguenta tornarà ensajar.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Lo tèxte original e las traduccions que ne son fachas seràn provesits als autres sites que installan la meteissa version.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Lo paquet declara pas cap de fichièr de traduccion principal.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Lo paquet a pas de %s pel son pròpri domeni de tèxte.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Lo genre « %1$s » del manifèst del paquet correspond pas al genre demandat « %2$s ».','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Lo paquet a pas produch cap de fichièr de traduccion principal servible.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Lo domeni de tèxte « %1$s » del paquet correspond pas a la còpia d\'aqueste site del composant (« %2$s »), doncas es pas estat installat.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Lo component empaquetat a pas pogut èsser legit.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Lo desfís d\'enregistrament es pas dins la forma esperada.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Lo rapòrt a pas pogut èstre enviat.','The search could not be completed.'=>'La recèrca a pas pogut s\'acabar.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Lo servici a demandat a aqueste site d\'esperar abans de tornar sincronizar.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Lo servici a pas pogut jónher vòstre site. Un parafuòc, un empeuton de seguretat o una règla de l\'albergador bloca probablament la requèsta; permetètz las requèstas cap a /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'L\'ofèrta de mandadís del servici èra incompleta.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Lo domeni de tèxte « %1$s » (%2$s) es ja servit per un autre composant installat (%3$s) ; res es pas estat installat.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Lo cargament es gardat fins a çò que demandetz a Babilim de lo suprimir.','Theme'=>'Tèma','Theme · %s'=>'Tèma · %s','Themes'=>'Tèmas','There is no upload in progress.'=>'I a pas cap de cargament en cors.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'I a pas cap de cargament en espèra de confirmacion.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Aquestas son las lengas qu\'utiliza aqueste site. Las podètz cambiar dins %s.','These fields will be sent:'=>'Aquestes camps seràn enviats :','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Aquesta build es pas una qu\'aqueste site coneis actualament per aqueste composant/paramètres de lenga.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Aqueste composant declara pas de numèro de version, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Aqueste composant es mai gròs que çò que lo servici accepta, doncas pòt pas èsser mandat al servici.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Aqueste composant es ja estat mandat. Babilim lo verifica ara.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Lo numèro de version d\'aqueste composant fa mai de %d caractèrs, çò que Babilim pòt pas gerir, doncas una traduccion pòt pas èsser demandada per el.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Aquò emet un nòu còdi de restauracion e l\'ancian s\'arrèsta de fonccionar. Contunhar?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Aqueste malhum a tròp de sites per los verificar un per un, e qualques-uns pòdon èsser configurats per escafar lor identitat Babilim quand l\'empeuton es suprimit. La licéncia pagada ligada a un tal site poiriá alara pas èsser restaurada automaticament; auriatz de contactar l\'Assisténcia de Babilim a %s. Per gardar las identitats, quichatz Anullar, descochatz « Suprimir totas las donadas de Babilim a la desinstallacion » dins los paramètres Babilim de cada site, e tornatz desactivar. Desactivar çaquelà?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'La version d\'aqueste empeuton, per que lo servici vos pòsca dire de lo metre a jorn s\'es tròp ancian per comunicar.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Aqueste rapòrt indica pas un Nom d\'empeuton o de tèma e de paramètres de lenga validses.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Aqueste rapòrt cita pas cap de cadena installada.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'A aqueste rapòrt li manca una compilacion valida a la quala èsser associat.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Aqueste rapòrt serà publicat publicament sus GitHub e poiriá èstre gardat per de tèrces.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Aqueste còdi de restauracion es pas estat reconegut per aqueste site.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Aqueste site a ja un enregistrament actiu que pòt plus èstre recuperat automaticament.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Aqueste site a %1$d composants dins %2$d lengas, çò que necessita %3$d lòts de verificacion ; Babilim ne pòt tractar al maximum %4$d per execucion. Reduisètz las lengas gerididas dins los Paramètres o desactivatz las extensions e tèmas pas utilizats, puèi quichatz Tornar verificar ara.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Aqueste site a pas cap de crompa per mostrar un còdi.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Aqueste site es ja jos licéncia. Tornatz cargar la pagina.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Aqueste site es pas encara enregistrat amb Babilim.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Aqueste sit depassa la talha que lo servici accepta en una sola sincronizacion, doncas unes elements son estats daissats de caire : %1$d components e %2$d lengas.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Aqueste site fa part d\'una ret multisite, que installa pas de novèlas traduccions automaticament. Las traduccions ja installadas son pasmens meses a jorn.','This site is verified.'=>'Aqueste site es verificat.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Aqueste site deu èstre verificat d\'en primièr.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'L\'URL d\'aqueste site, per que lo servici pòsca verificar que ne sètz lo proprietari.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'L\'adreça d\'aqueste site es tròp longa per que Babilim l\'enregistre.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Los paramètres de lenga configurats d\'aqueste site.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Lo còde de lenga d\'aqueste site es pas un còde que Babilim pòt enregistrar.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Aquesta cadena pòt pas èstre senhalada dempuèi aqueste site.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Aquesta cadena es pas parmi las traduccions installadas sus aqueste site. Tornatz cercar e causissètz-la dins la lista.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Aquesta traduccion es estada mesa a jorn dempuèi vòstra recèrca. Tornatz cercar e causissètz la cadena dins la novèla lista.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Per traduire aqueste composant, Babilim a besonh de sa font.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Tròp de ensages. Tornatz ensajar deman.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Tròp de rapòrts uèi. Tornatz ensajar deman.','Too many requests.'=>'Tròp de requèstas.','Toolbar'=>'Barra d\'espleches','Translating…'=>'Traduccion en cors…','Translation does not load'=>'La traduccion se càrga pas','Translation failed'=>'La traduccion a fracassat','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Los fichièrs de traduccion que metètz dins %s an totjorn prioritat sus los de Babilim. Son gardats levat que desmarquetz aquesta casa.','Translation requested.'=>'Traduccion demandada.','Translations'=>'Traduccions','Type'=>'Tipe','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Picatz almens 2 caractèrs per cercar.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Responsa HTTP %d imprevista.','Uninstall'=>'Desinstallar','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Genre desconegut : %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Domeni pas segur : %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Paramètres de lenga pas segurs : %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Slug pas segur : %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'text_domain pas segur : %s','Update'=>'Metre a jorn','Update available'=>'Actualizacion disponibla','Updates'=>'Mesas a jorn','Updating…'=>'Mesa a jorn…','Upgrade this site'=>'Melhorar aqueste site','Upload and request'=>'Cargar e demandar','Upload cancelled.'=>'Mandadís anullat.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Mandadís acabat — traduccion demandada.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Lo mandadís a expirat abans d\'acabar','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Mandadís en cors — contunhar o anullar','Upload this component?'=>'Mandar aqueste composant?','Upload was not accepted'=>'Lo mandadís es estat refusat','Uploading'=>'Cargament','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Cargament de la partida %1$d sus %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Cargament…','Verified'=>'Verificat','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'A la responsa de verificacion li mancava site_token.','Version %s'=>'Version %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Çò qu\'es enviat quand activatz Babilim','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Quand quicòm fracassa dins Babilim, enviar un rapòrt d\'error al servici Babilim per que siá publicat coma un problèma public sus GitHub. Lo rapòrt es enviat coma venent d\'aqueste site, amb la meteissa autentificacion que cada autra requèsta al servici Babilim. Lo servici publica pas que lo còdi d\'error e las versions coma un problèma public sus GitHub ; lo problèma public conten ni adreça del site, ni contengut, ni camins de fichièrs. Desactivat per defaut.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'O ont l\'avètz vist (facultatiu)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Quand aquò es activat, las traduccions que lo servici indica coma disponiblas per las lengas que gerissètz son installadas pendent la sincronizacion doas còps per jorn.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Incorrècte per aqueste contèxte','Wrong meaning'=>'Sens incorrècte','Wrong plural form'=>'Forma de plural incorrècta','Wrong term'=>'Tèrme incorrècte','Yes'=>'Òc','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Sètz pas autorizat a far aquò.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Vòstra version de PHP, per la compatibilitat.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Vòstra version de WordPress, per provesir de fichièrs de traduccion compatibles.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Vòstre nòu còdi de restauracion : %s. Gardatz-lo en lòc segur — l\'ancian còdi fonciona pas mai.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Vòstre rapòrt es tractat automaticament per de modèls AI e poiriá melhorar aquesta traduccion per d\'autres sites.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Vòstre site a respondut, mas pas amb çò qu\'èra esperat. L\'API REST pòt èsser reescrita per un autre empeuton, o aqueste punt d\'accès pòt èsser en cache; excluètz /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge del cache e de la reescritura.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Vòstre sit a mes tròp de temps a respondre. Tornatz ensajar mai tard e verificatz que vòstre servidor d\'albergament siá pas tròp lent o subrecargat.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Lo zip a pas de manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Al zip li manca un fichièr per defaut esperat : %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Al zip li manca un fichièr esperat : %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json a una estructura imprevista','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'impossible de legir _manifest.json : %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Lo camp « %s » d\'expected_manifest manca o es invalid.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Lo camp « server_build_id » d\'expected_manifest es pas un id de build valid.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Fracàs de l\'analisi de _manifest.json : %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'daissariá orfanèls %1$d sus %2$d composants gerits (mai de la mitat)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'daissariá orfanèl cada composant gerit de tipe %1$s (%2$d sus %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Discordança del nombre d\'entradas l10n.php per %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json a un camp « default_domain_entries » invalid.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json a un camp « default_domain_files » invalid.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'Lo manifest.json dins lo zip es pas un JSON valid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'Lo camp « %s » de manifest.json manca o es invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'Lo camp « build_no » de manifest.json manca o es invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'Lo camp « entries » de manifest.json manca o es invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'Lo camp « extra_domains » de manifest.json manca o es invalid.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'Lo camp « files » de manifest.json manca o es invalid.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'Lo camp « %s » de manifest.json correspond pas a la valor esperada.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'Lo camp « contract » de manifest.json es pas una cadena de version valida.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'Lo camp \'kind\' de manifest.json deu èsser \'plugin\' o \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'Lo camp « server_build_id » de manifest.json es pas un id de build valid.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'Lo camp « status » de manifest.json deu èsser « published ».','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce deu èsser una cadena exadecimala.','per day'=>'per jorn','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'Discordança de sha256 per %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'Discordança de sha256 per default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'extension','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'tèma','problem report categoryOther'=>'Autre','translation statusAvailable'=>'Disponibla','translation statusInstalled'=>'Installat','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Traduccion Babilim desactivada.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Arrestar d\'utilizar la traduccion Babilim','Use Babilim translation'=>'Utilizar la traduccion Babilim','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Arrestar d\'utilizar la traduccion Babilim de %1$s (%2$s) ? WordPress utilizarà a la plaça la traduccion pròpria del tèma o la traduccion WordPress.org. Podètz tornar en darrièr a tot moment.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Arrestar d\'utilizar la traduccion Babilim de %1$s (%2$s) ? WordPress utilizarà a la plaça la traduccion pròpria de l\'extension o la traduccion WordPress.org. Podètz tornar en darrièr a tot moment.']];